**`Gazelle.java`**, **`Mouse.java`**, **`FennecFox.java`** — Still have original private static final constants. NOT YET updated to use SimulationConfiguration.

**`Grass.java`** — Simplified using Plant template. Still has `private static final` constants (`MAX_AGE=20`, `REPRODUCTION_PROBABILITY=0.44`, `MAX_LITTER_SIZE=6`, `GRASS_FOOD_VALUE=10`). NOT YET updated to use SimulationConfiguration.

**`SimulationEntity.java`** — NEW. Abstract base implementing Actor, holds Field reference.
```java
public abstract class SimulationEntity implements Actor {
    private Field field;
